  "description": "FRONT GARDEN\t\t\r\n\r\nT1\tTree Of Heaven (Alianthus altissima)\tCrown reduce by approximately 2-3m back to most recent previous reduction points as tree has become too large. School next door has complained about lack of light and a large amount of bird mess on their property. Final height 13m and spread 7m.\t\r\n\r\nREAR GARDEN\t\t\r\n\r\nT2\tHolm Oak - Evergreen Oak (Quercus ilex)\t20% crown reduction - reducing the height and spread of the tree by approximately 2m all round to contain and rebalance. Crown lift by approximately 2m all round as tree is drooping down close to neighbours outbuilding. Remove low epicormic growth from the main stem. Final height 14m and spread 8m. \t\r\n\r\nT3 Cherry (Prunus spp) 20% Crown Reduction - Reducing the height and spread of the tree by approximately 1-2m to tidy and contain,\r\nretaining furnishing growth. Crown lift all round by 1-2m to give clearance from neighbours house and balance. Final height 6m final spread\r\n4m.",
